Z||000000||FieroLisa||05-25-2001||01:09 PM||||Well guys I'm about to pack up the Fiero and start driving to Indy for the race this weekend!! I'll be sure to take lots of pics...I should be out on the track when the engines are being started again this year, so the pics will be good!!<P>Just pray with me that it doesn't rain, I wanna see Arie WIN!!!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A>||||reg||1
