Z||000002||ChadMan||05-25-2001||01:59 PM||||Have fun, Lisa!  This is going to be one of the best 500's ever...I honestly think there are at least 20 drivers with a legitimate shot at winning the race, and probably another 5 with a long shot.  All bets are off!<P>Too bad it will be rained out and held Monday afternoon.  God, how I hate Midwestern weather.||||reg||1
