Z||000004||Ken Wittlief||05-25-2001||03:17 PM||||I knew a guy whos aunt got killed many years ago, when a car slammed into the rail right in front of the bleacher, and spewed parts and fuel into the crowd.<P>  she was hit by a wheel and killed instantly.<P>  After a few years he developed a sense of humor about it. thought he might have her tombstone changed to "here lies aunt mary, shes not dead, she just got tired"<P>  he still went to indy every year anyway.<p>[This message has been edited by Ken Wittlief (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||1
