Z||000009||FieroLisa||05-25-2001||11:10 PM||||Report From Indy: Got here, went to a dinner, Arie made an appearance and I got to talk to him for a bit, as did Felipe Giafonne...also Sam Schimdt came, since he is the owner of Davey Hamilton's team.<P>Ken, already got ya what you asked for!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Tomorrow at like 9 I'm going to the track to wander around and if the weather is OK, shoulkd get a ride in the Pace Car...which I don't even know what it is this year though...<P>Also the hotel gave us these cool Indy 500 history books...and if ya turn to 1984 There's 3 pics of the Fiero that paced it!||||reg||1
